h County</span><svg class="ico sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></li><li class="rv"><a href="/utah-communities/ogden/"><span class="c-name">Ogden</span><span class="c-county">Weber County</span><svg class="ico sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></li><li class="rv"><a href="/utah-communities/layton/"><span class="c-name">Layton</span><span class="c-county">Davis County</span><svg class="ico sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></li><li class="rv"><a href="/utah-communities/st-george/"><span class="c-name">St. George</span><span class="c-county">Washington County</span><svg class="ico sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></li><li class="rv"><a href="/utah-communities/logan/"><span class="c-name">Logan</span><span class="c-county">Cache County</span><svg class="ico sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></li><li class="rv"><a href="/utah-communities/park-city/"><span class="c-name">Park City</span><span class="c-county">Summit County</span><svg class="ico sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></li><li class="rv"><a href="/utah-communities/cedar-city/"><span class="c-name">Cedar City</span><span class="c-county">Iron County</span><svg class="ico sm" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></li></ul></div></section>
<section class="sec sec-sand"><div class="shell"><div class="sec-head left rv"><p class="kicker dark">Regions</p><h2>How claims differ across Utah</h2><p>The same policy language plays out very differently in an Avenues bungalow, a Park City condo and a St. George stucco home.</p></div><div class="reg-grid" data-stagger><div class="reg-card rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/slc-skyline.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/slc-skyline-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/slc-skyline.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><small>Salt Lake, Davis &amp; Weber counties</small><h2 class="h3">Wasatch Front</h2><p>Canyon windstorms, summer hail, ice dams and the occasional tornado, layered over century-old brick homes, mid-century ranches and high-rise condos.</p></div></div><div class="reg-card rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/provo.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/provo-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/provo.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><small>Provo, Orem, Lehi &amp; south county</small><h2 class="h3">Utah Valley</h2><p>Fast-growing subdivisions, student rentals and foothill homes exposed to hail, wildfire smoke and winter water losses.</p></div></div><div class="reg-card rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/park-city.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/park-city-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/park-city.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><small>Park City, Heber &amp; Ogden Valley</small><h2 class="h3">Mountain resorts</h2><p>The heaviest snow loads in the state, frozen pipes in empty second homes and high-end finishes that valley pricing misses.</p></div></div><div class="reg-card rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/logan.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/logan-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/logan.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><small>Logan &amp; Cache Valley</small><h2 class="h3">Northern valleys</h2><p>Long, cold winters and agricultural outbuildings make frozen pipes, snow-load collapses and barn claims a regular pattern.</p></div></div><div class="reg-card rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/st-george.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/st-george-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/st-george.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="1024" height="678" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><small>St. George, Cedar City &amp; Iron County</small><h2 class="h3">Southern Utah</h2><p>Monsoon wind, flash floods, stucco and tile roofs, plus wildfire country around Brian Head and Cedar Mountain.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
